#: src/Modules/Analytics/Frontend/FrontendEvalCoverageView.php:56
msgid ""
"This report covers the whole academy, and your analytics access is limited "
"to your own teams."
msgstr ""
"Dit rapport gaat over de hele academie, en jouw analysetoegang is beperkt "
"tot je eigen teams."

#: src/Modules/Analytics/Frontend/FrontendExploreView.php:72
msgid ""
"The explorer reads across the whole academy, and your analytics access is "
"limited to your own teams."
msgstr ""
"De verkenner leest over de hele academie, en jouw analysetoegang is beperkt "
"tot je eigen teams."

#: src/Modules/Analytics/Frontend/FrontendScheduledReportsView.php:68
msgid ""
"Scheduled reports are managed academy-wide, and your analytics access is "
"limited to your own teams."
msgstr ""
"Geplande rapporten worden academiebreed beheerd, en jouw analysetoegang is "
"beperkt tot je eigen teams."

#: src/Modules/Analytics/Frontend/FrontendAnalyticsView.php:76
msgid ""
"Your analytics access is limited to your own teams, and this is not one of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Jouw analysetoegang is beperkt tot je eigen teams, en dit is er daar geen "
"van."

#: src/Modules/Analytics/Frontend/FrontendAnalyticsView.php:105
msgid ""
"Academy-wide KPIs need analytics access across the whole club. Pick one of "
"your teams, its players or an activity on the left to see their analytics."
msgstr ""
"Academiebrede KPI's vragen analysetoegang over de hele club. Kies links een "
"van je teams, zijn spelers of een activiteit om hun analyses te zien."

#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendStandardReportsView.php:349
msgid "This team is outside your access, so this report cannot be shown for it."
msgstr ""
"Dit team valt buiten jouw toegang, dus dit rapport kan er niet voor worden "
"getoond."
